msgctxt "388"
msgid "Kiryu-san!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "400"
msgid "Thanks for waiting."
msgstr "Grazie per l'attesa."

msgctxt "412"
msgid "Who is that?"
msgstr "Chi è quello?"

msgctxt "424"
msgid "Why'd you bring someone else? I thought it was gonna be just us."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "436"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "448"
msgid "Well, I'll be waiting here. Please come back when you're alone, okay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "460"
msgid "You're finally here... I was worried you might not be coming..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "472"
msgid "Sorry."
msgstr "Scusa."

msgctxt "484"
msgid "I'll forgive you this time..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "508"
msgid "Oh, I had something funny happen to me recently..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "520"
msgid ""
"A little while ago, some random person approached me on the street, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "532"
msgid ""
"He was like, \"Wanna be a model in a fashion magazine?\" trying to scout me "
"and stuff."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "544"
msgid "What did you say?"
msgstr "Cosa hai risposto?"

msgctxt "556"
msgid ""
"There were tons of girls walking around, so I didn't realize he was talking "
"to me at first."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "568"
msgid "I was like, \"You want <Italic>me</Italic> to be a model?\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "580"
msgid ""
"I totally thought he was just being mean. Using me as the butt of a joke, "
"you know?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "592"
msgid ""
"But when I realized he was serious, I was, like... well... What was I "
"supposed to say?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "604"
msgid "How could someone like me be a model?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "616"
msgid "There's no harm in trying, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "628"
msgid ""
"How can I go out in front of so many people? No way am I pretty enough."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "640"
msgid "You'll do great."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "652"
msgid ""
"Hehehe. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> Oh, Kiryu-san. When you say it, I can "
"almost believe it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "688"
msgid "Sorry for everything, Kiryu-san..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "700"
msgid "I know I'm always such a pain for you..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "712"
msgid "You aren't. Don't worry about it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "724"
msgid "Kiryu-san... You're really not mad?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "736"
msgid "You really don't think I'm just a hopeless airhead?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "748"
msgid "What gave you that idea?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "760"
msgid "Sorry... I think I'm just a little tired..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "772"
msgid ""
"I never like saying what's on my mind because I don't want people to worry "
"about me..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "784"
msgid ""
"I mean, it's not like I don't have things I want to do and say, you know? "
"But I can live with not doing them if it means not rocking the boat..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "796"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "808"
msgid "So I just keep my pain to myself..."
